```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
xt <- dimarco2020$burnout / sd(dimarco2020$burnout)
head(dimarco2020$burnout)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 1.8 1.4 2.7 1.9 2.6 2.1
```


:::

